r":"pei","quote":"弘，后为扬州、凉州刺史，以果烈死事于边。","attribution":"裴注·《晋书》","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":280,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aeaedf6f24d38daee210","start":10,"end":30,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mantian-q-56068a14592392d5c638","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-b6e42f6564b8a81703c8","layer":"original","quote":"咸熙中，为振威护军","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":260,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":29,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mantian-q-dab8228669bc5cb2230e","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-b6e42f6564b8a81703c8","layer":"original","quote":"以陇西太守随邓艾伐蜀有功","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":260,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o166a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b237d0439beadd09325c","layer":"original","quote":"夏五月，诏曰：“蜀，蕞尔小国〖2〗，土狭民寡。而姜维虐用其众，曾无废志〖3〗。往岁破败之后，犹复耕种沓中〖4〗，刻剥众羌，劳役无已，民不堪命。夫‘兼弱攻昧〖5〗，武之善经’；‘致人而不致于人〖6〗’，兵家之上略。蜀所恃赖，唯维而已；因其远离巢窟〖7〗，用力为易。今使征西将军邓艾督帅诸军，趋甘松、沓中以罗取维〖8〗；雍州刺史诸葛绪督诸军，趋（武都、高楼）〔武街、桥头〕〖9〗：首尾蹴讨。若擒维，便当东西并进，扫灭巴蜀也。”又命镇西将军钟会由骆谷伐蜀〖10〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":195,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":229,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：景元四年（公元 263）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ef642248e44d01f3825d","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o165","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b35fdf03685051716720","layer":"original","quote":"四年春二月〖1〗，复命大将军进位、爵赐，一如前诏。又固辞，乃止。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0046","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-23e8850b8ee57e7e439c","layer":"original","quote":"四年秋，诏诸军征蜀，大将军司马文王皆指授节度。使艾与维相缀连〖2〗，雍州刺史诸葛绪邀维〖3〗：令不得归。艾遣天水太守王颀等直攻维营，陇西太守牵弘等邀其前，金城太守杨欣等诣甘松〖4〗。维闻钟会诸军已入汉中，引退还。欣等追蹑于强川口〖5〗，大战。维败走。闻雍州已塞道〖6〗，屯桥头〖7〗；从孔函谷入北道〖8〗，欲出雍州后。诸葛绪闻之，却还三十里〖9〗。维入北道三十余里，闻绪军却，寻还，从桥头过；绪趋截维，较一日不及〖10〗。维遂东引，还守剑阁〖11〗。钟会攻维未能克。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":322,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":233,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0051","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-3b75cd8087fec2db4ca3","layer":"original","quote":"辄依邓禹故事〖2〗，承制拜禅行骠骑将军，太子奉车〖3〗，诸王驸马都尉〖4〗。蜀群司各随高下，拜为王官，或领艾官属。以师纂领益州刺史，陇西太守牵弘等领蜀中诸郡。使于绵竹筑台以为京观〖5〗，用彰战功。士卒死事者，皆与蜀兵同共埋藏。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":348,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":113,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0070","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a8c7cff17ae8b7e5d8a8","layer":"original","quote":"四年秋〖1〗，乃下诏使邓艾、诸葛绪各统诸军三万余人：艾趋甘松、沓中，连缀维；绪趋武街，桥头〖2〗，绝维归路。会统十余万众，分从斜谷、骆谷入〖3〗。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":471,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0370","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-23e8850b8ee57e7e439c","layer":"original","quote":"使艾与维相缀连〖2〗，雍州刺史诸葛绪邀维〖3〗：令不得归","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":322,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":23,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0371","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-23e8850b8ee57e7e439c","layer":"original","quote":"艾遣天水太守王颀等直攻维营，陇西太守牵弘等邀其前，金城太守杨欣等诣甘松","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":322,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":52,"end":87,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0389","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-3b75cd8087fec2db4ca3","layer":"original","quote":"以师纂领益州刺史，陇西太守牵弘等领蜀中诸郡","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":348,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":57,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0449","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a8c7cff17ae8b7e5d8a8","layer":"original","quote":"四年秋〖1〗，乃下诏使邓艾、诸葛绪各统诸军三万余人：艾趋甘松、沓中，连缀维；绪趋武街，桥头〖2〗，绝维归路","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":471,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
